{"4887260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Anatolian Leopard", "steam_appid": 4887260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Folk and cosmic horror</strong> meet in an Anatolian village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You are a zoologist, and capturing a photo of the Anatolian Leopard is your childhood dream. With just one suitcase, you set out for a remote Anatolian village. If you succeed, it could even be your ticket back to the academy. But things will not be easy. You will face a bizarre truth about the villagers, and soon, your exploration will turn into a dreamlike horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime:</strong> Around 30-40 minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration:</strong> Use your camera and sound recorder to capture photos and record sounds to find the rare leopard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Encounters:</strong> Discover the bizarre truth hidden within the Anatolian village.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dream-like horror:</strong> What starts as a normal science trip turns into a surreal, cosmic nightmare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short narrative game:</strong> It is a short, story-driven experience.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Folk and cosmic horror</strong> meet in an Anatolian village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You are a zoologist, and capturing a photo of the Anatolian Leopard is your childhood dream. With just one suitcase, you set out for a remote Anatolian village. If you succeed, it could even be your ticket back to the academy. But things will not be easy. You will face a bizarre truth about the villagers, and soon, your exploration will turn into a dreamlike horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime:</strong> Around 30-40 minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration:</strong> Use your camera and sound recorder to capture photos and record sounds to find the rare leopard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Encounters:</strong> Discover the bizarre truth hidden within the Anatolian village.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dream-like horror:</strong> What starts as a normal science trip turns into a surreal, cosmic nightmare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short narrative game:</strong> It is a short, story-driven experience.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Arrive in a desolate Anatolian village as a zoologist searching for the elusive Anatolian Leopard. What begins as a routine expedition soon descends into a nightmare haunted by local folklore, dark secrets, and cosmic horror", "supported_languages": "English, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887260/b73e7f5706a8425f61f9955fbd751680182f8829/header.jpg?t=1783543541", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887260/8bbabfdb736a808f08bb6fe4c2e34b23e4749396/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783543541", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887260/8bbabfdb736a808f08bb6fe4c2e34b23e4749396/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783543541", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5-2300 | AMD FX-6350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graph